text: >
  Brutal Blitz: When you rush headlong into battle, you can turn your momentum into power.
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Requirement: Blitz Profile.
  –Effect: If you move a number of Squares equal to your Boosted Speed through the effects of Charging Assault, you may use your Agility as the Damage Attribute for that Attacking Maneuver.

